<title>USA: Smith Residential names Minami as CFO.</title>
<headline>Smith Residential names Minami as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charles E. Smith Residential Realty, Inc said Wednesday that W.D. &quot;Denny&quot; Minami has joined the company as senior vice president and chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Mr. Minami previously served as CFO of Ascent Entertainment Group Inc, treasurer of Comsat Corp and CFO at Oxford Realty Services Corp.</p>
</text>
